# 🚗 Car Management System in Java
-------------------------------------

## Description

This is a simple Java console application that helps manage a car showroom.  
Users can add and view details of:

- Showrooms  
- Employees  
- Cars  

It uses basic Java concepts like classes, arrays, interfaces, and user input.

---

## Features

- Add showroom, employee, and car details  
- View all saved data  
- Menu-driven interface for easy navigation  
- Uses OOP concepts and interface for code reusability  

---

## Technologies Used

- Java  
- Scanner (for input)  
- Arrays and Interfaces  

---

## How to Run

1. Compile the code:  
   ```bash
   javac *.java
2. Run the application:
    bash:
  java Main

Project Files:
--------------
Main.java – Controls main logic and menu

Showroom.java – Showroom details class

Employees.java – Employee details class

Cars.java – Car details class

utility.java – Interface with set_details() and get_details() methods

